1, …</i><span style=\"color:rgb(68,84,106);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">”</span></div><div>2. Updated parameters also to <b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(68,84,106)\">b_betaX1 </span></b>, etc. Error was <span style=\"color:rgb(68,84,106);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">“</span><i style=\"color:rgb(68,84,106);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">Parameter\r\nnames should not contain dots or underscores</i><span style=\"color:rgb(68,84,106);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">”.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,84,106);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><br></span></div><div>Is my syntax wrong? Appreciate any help on this.</div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
